WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.730
NEO KYOTO UNIVERSITY STUDENT UNION

00:00:03.230 --> 00:00:07.110
Hey Teruto, can you be a little less tense?

00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:08.480
That's my Master!

00:00:08.770 --> 00:00:12.490
So calm and collected even right
in front of the enemy's hideout.

00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:13.700
Huh?

00:00:14.150 --> 00:00:16.740
I'm only here because you told me to come.

00:00:16.740 --> 00:00:21.330
Don't tell me you weren't listening when
I told you there were challengers here.

00:00:18.830 --> 00:00:21.330
FEATURING POPULAR SHOPS!!

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:25.210
What kind of people are they?

00:00:25.210 --> 00:00:27.590
In the Department of Sorcery at Neo Kyoto University,

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:32.210
I heard about a group that lowered
the risk of losing by sharing their key chips.

00:00:32.510 --> 00:00:38.260
Rumor is they abduct people from the outer district,
and use them as guinea pigs for their magic research.

00:00:38.260 --> 00:00:41.060
I heard that this group meets up here.

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:45.940
We're going to take down all the bad guys,
and rake in tons of chips!

00:00:54.110 --> 00:00:57.530
What? They all got taken out?

00:00:57.740 --> 00:00:59.580
These guys are the enemy?

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:03.330
Gone. Gone. Gone.

00:01:03.580 --> 00:01:06.960
My chips are gone!

00:01:07.290 --> 00:01:09.420
We're just going to have to find the next ones.

00:01:09.420 --> 00:01:12.090
Well! You sure sound gung-ho, Master.

00:01:12.090 --> 00:01:13.420
To battle, yeah.

00:01:13.510 --> 00:01:15.720
Meaning I'm the one who has to do the searching.

00:01:16.090 --> 00:01:19.010
That's right, we should call an ambulance.

00:01:16.260 --> 00:01:19.550
Who was it that snatched those chips?

00:01:19.680 --> 00:01:20.930
INFORMATION WANTED

00:03:00.950 --> 00:03:04.450
#03 Fiery Feelings

00:03:09.160 --> 00:03:11.120
LET'S BUILD EQUALITY WITH CARDS!

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:13.130
GIVE EVERYONE THE RIGHT TO CHALLENGE!

00:03:13.460 --> 00:03:17.000
They're nowhere to be found, those challengers.

00:03:19.800 --> 00:03:25.640
SOCIETY FOR VULNERABLE CARD PLAYERS

00:03:20.090 --> 00:03:22.130
The strong need to be handicapped.

00:03:22.430 --> 00:03:25.640
So we can have a society where anyone can win.

00:03:26.060 --> 00:03:28.850
I wonder if any of them have the chips?

00:03:29.140 --> 00:03:30.890
Huh? Master?

00:03:30.890 --> 00:03:32.940
Huh? Where did he go?

00:03:40.150 --> 00:03:41.740
We're with Neo Kyoto Television.

00:03:41.740 --> 00:03:44.820
Can you tell me why you want to win at Build-Divide?

00:03:44.820 --> 00:03:45.410
Huh?

00:03:45.780 --> 00:03:46.660
Uh...

00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:49.410
I want to put my daughter in a certified kindergarten.

00:03:49.790 --> 00:03:52.870
I need to win to get a grant from my university.

00:03:52.870 --> 00:03:57.000
At my company, if you keep losing,
you end up getting fired.

00:03:57.000 --> 00:03:58.000
How about you?

00:03:58.300 --> 00:03:59.300
Um...

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:02.220
I want to eat bread.

00:04:02.760 --> 00:04:05.140
Oh no. You can't even get a decent meal?

00:04:05.140 --> 00:04:05.890
Huh?

00:04:06.180 --> 00:04:08.600
I can't believe there's a kid in such a sad state.

00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:09.520
Come on, smile.

00:04:09.520 --> 00:04:10.890
Follow us!

00:04:11.180 --> 00:04:11.850
Hey!

00:04:12.100 --> 00:04:14.520
All right everybody, all together now.

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:19.730
We need victory! We need victory!

00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:19.280
Let me out of here...

00:04:21.690 --> 00:04:22.700
This way.

00:04:23.990 --> 00:04:27.490
Master. Answer me please!

00:04:27.490 --> 00:04:29.080
Seriously...

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:35.790
Sorry Hiyori. Mind if I leave Teruto to you?

00:04:35.790 --> 00:04:37.840
Whoa, hey Sakura!

00:04:38.090 --> 00:04:39.670
Where are you going?

00:04:42.880 --> 00:04:44.260
Are you all right?

00:04:45.680 --> 00:04:47.640
Yeah. I owe you one.

00:04:47.640 --> 00:04:50.390
It's all good. I don't mind helping people out.

00:04:50.760 --> 00:04:51.850
Thanks.

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:54.020
Right. See you.

00:04:55.480 --> 00:04:56.400
What's wrong?

00:04:56.480 --> 00:04:58.400
There should be a bakery around here.

00:04:59.270 --> 00:05:00.980
If you're heading back, it's that way.

00:05:01.780 --> 00:05:03.240
I'm not lost.

00:05:05.990 --> 00:05:08.280
Uh, it's not that way either.

00:05:15.830 --> 00:05:17.040
Ishinome?

00:05:17.170 --> 00:05:17.710
Huh?

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:20.920
I'm impressed that you recognized me.

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:24.760
Who else but you still reads
an actual paper in this day and age?

00:05:26.130 --> 00:05:27.340
Thank you for your patience!

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:30.010
Whoa, adorable!

00:05:30.010 --> 00:05:31.350
And for you?

00:05:31.470 --> 00:05:33.060
I'll have coffee.

00:05:33.140 --> 00:05:34.430
Very well.

00:05:36.940 --> 00:05:38.850
Listen, you know who it is right?

00:05:39.020 --> 00:05:40.980
The one who stole all those chips?

00:05:41.150 --> 00:05:42.900
Give me one second, okay?

00:05:43.070 --> 00:05:46.700
Which angle shows off your best side?

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:49.160
Just tell me already.

00:05:50.620 --> 00:05:54.040
This old guy would rather talk about more fun stuff.

00:05:54.040 --> 00:05:56.500
Since I have this delectable parfait in front of me.

00:05:58.250 --> 00:05:59.540
Again with the paper?

00:05:59.540 --> 00:06:02.340
Perfect for these top secret communications.

00:06:03.880 --> 00:06:06.380
I don't know about letting you have it for free.

00:06:06.800 --> 00:06:09.050
I mean, it's a lot of work you know?

00:06:09.050 --> 00:06:15.520
I was able to pilfer those chips for you,
but I couldn't get you into a Rebuild.

00:06:21.560 --> 00:06:24.110
Weren't you going to help me out?

00:06:24.110 --> 00:06:26.440
Sorry, sorry. Here.

00:06:28.900 --> 00:06:30.870
It's mainly all about him.

00:06:31.660 --> 00:06:34.030
Do all you can to incite him, okay?

00:06:34.540 --> 00:06:36.410
Naomitsu Enjo.

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:38.330
He's got this many chips?

00:06:41.380 --> 00:06:43.630
This is your house?

00:06:43.630 --> 00:06:44.420
Yeah.

00:06:48.050 --> 00:06:50.630
So you've really been having a rough time.

00:06:50.930 --> 00:06:51.840
This is my thanks.

00:06:51.840 --> 00:06:52.850
Right.

00:06:53.640 --> 00:06:55.560
But this is like precious stuff.

00:06:57.890 --> 00:06:59.270
Black, huh?

00:07:05.190 --> 00:07:08.240
Hey, what do you think of Exclusionism?

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:11.570
Look at how you're living,
thanks to that philosophy.

00:07:11.570 --> 00:07:14.700
You can't even get a decent meal.
Are you okay with that?

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:16.700
I like my tent.

00:07:16.790 --> 00:07:19.040
Having coffee like this is good.

00:07:19.460 --> 00:07:23.500
So you're just going to swallow up
all the bitterness and move on?

00:07:24.420 --> 00:07:26.590
There's a path that I've got to follow.

00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:30.590
So you can't drink black coffee?

00:07:30.880 --> 00:07:32.640
I can drink it.

00:07:37.560 --> 00:07:39.850
I'm fed up with the system here!

00:07:40.480 --> 00:07:44.810
There are people who've been forced to the
outer district because they can't win at Build-Divide.

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:48.780
Meanwhile, all the people across the river do
is trample over others with their cards.

00:07:49.150 --> 00:07:51.900
Never giving a second thought to the lives of the weak.

00:07:52.240 --> 00:07:53.860
So I'm going to defeat the King.

00:07:54.030 --> 00:07:56.030
Me, with my own hands.

00:07:59.080 --> 00:08:01.040
My name is Naomitsu Enjo.

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:04.330
I'm Teruto Kurabe.

00:08:04.750 --> 00:08:07.920
Teruto, if anything happens, you come to me.

00:08:08.300 --> 00:08:09.710
I'll stop by again sometime.

00:08:10.050 --> 00:08:10.840
Yeah.

00:08:18.180 --> 00:08:20.600
How bitter was that coffee, anyway?

00:08:23.390 --> 00:08:25.310
You're Naomitsu Enjo, right?

00:08:25.440 --> 00:08:26.270
Who's this?

00:08:26.520 --> 00:08:28.480
I have a favor to ask of you.

00:08:28.650 --> 00:08:30.690
It's not a bad deal.

00:08:30.690 --> 00:08:33.200
That's what all villains say.

00:08:33.490 --> 00:08:35.610
I know all about you.

00:08:36.280 --> 00:08:39.700
You're a sophomore at the Royal University of Uji,
a political science major in the law department.

00:08:39.700 --> 00:08:42.750
Nineteen years old. Virgo. Blood type A.

00:08:42.750 --> 00:08:45.170
You have a strong sense of justice,
and you're impulsive.

00:08:45.580 --> 00:08:49.130
I know everything from where you live
down to your height and weight.

00:08:49.130 --> 00:08:51.380
Even the fact that you don't like bitter food.

00:08:51.510 --> 00:08:54.720
Needless to say, I know about your siblings too.

00:08:57.340 --> 00:09:00.010
How did you find out? Who the hell are you?

00:09:01.140 --> 00:09:04.480
There's someone that I want you to battle.

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:08.860
Wow!

00:09:08.860 --> 00:09:11.280
This is such a great view.

00:09:11.400 --> 00:09:13.400
So, where's this challenger?

00:09:13.400 --> 00:09:20.030
Right! From what I heard from Sakura,
he should be around here somewhere.

00:09:21.410 --> 00:09:23.950
I never thought you'd be the one to show up.

00:09:25.540 --> 00:09:26.830
You...

00:09:31.380 --> 00:09:34.220
So you were a challenger too, Teruto?

00:09:34.220 --> 00:09:36.430
You two know each other?

00:09:36.970 --> 00:09:38.760
Is this what you want?

00:09:38.760 --> 00:09:40.390
You've got seven chips?

00:09:40.850 --> 00:09:41.600
Yeah.

00:09:41.970 --> 00:09:43.100
I get it.

00:09:43.720 --> 00:09:48.690
If you can leave behind that way of life,
you're ready to become the King right?

00:09:49.190 --> 00:09:52.440
That's no reason to join forces with
those Department of Sorcery guys.

00:09:52.780 --> 00:09:54.530
You've really strayed off the path.

00:09:54.610 --> 00:09:57.200
Huh? What is he talking about?

00:09:58.450 --> 00:10:00.950
I'm going to follow my own path, that's all.

00:10:01.490 --> 00:10:03.740
Could you be any more directionally challenged?

00:10:04.660 --> 00:10:06.290
Take out your deck then.

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:08.000
You...

00:10:09.330 --> 00:10:11.340
Confirming Rebuild request.

00:10:11.340 --> 00:10:13.250
Please bet your key chips.

00:10:13.500 --> 00:10:15.130
Four chips, all in.

00:10:15.380 --> 00:10:17.300
You're betting them all again?

00:10:17.300 --> 00:10:18.760
Trying to provoke me?

00:10:19.300 --> 00:10:21.470
Competing without any risks is lame.

00:10:21.800 --> 00:10:24.560
I don't really want to battle you.

00:10:25.430 --> 00:10:26.850
I'll be betting four chips too.

00:10:27.690 --> 00:10:29.100
Rebuild established.

00:10:29.400 --> 00:10:31.230
Deploying defensive barrier.

00:10:37.360 --> 00:10:39.280
Call. Lionel.

00:10:45.240 --> 00:10:47.120
Call. Bloom.

00:10:53.170 --> 00:10:54.550
- Build-Divide.
- Build-Divide.

00:10:55.710 --> 00:10:57.090
I see they've started.

00:10:57.300 --> 00:10:59.590
Sakura, you're late.

00:10:59.880 --> 00:11:01.590
Where were you yesterday?

00:11:01.590 --> 00:11:02.850
I have a lot going on.

00:11:02.850 --> 00:11:07.220
The opponent. I don't know why,
but he's really mad at Master.

00:11:07.220 --> 00:11:09.140
Is he? That's odd.

00:11:09.600 --> 00:11:11.980
How did you find him anyway?

00:11:12.060 --> 00:11:13.940
It wasn't that easy.

00:11:13.940 --> 00:11:16.980
That man had seven chips.

00:11:16.980 --> 00:11:18.610
No matter how good Master is...

00:11:18.900 --> 00:11:21.070
Nothing ventured, nothing gained.

00:11:21.780 --> 00:11:23.280
That's what it's all about.

00:11:27.790 --> 00:11:28.910
End of turn.

00:11:28.910 --> 00:11:31.290
Now that guy only has six lives left.

00:11:31.330 --> 00:11:33.830
No damage to Master, he's ahead!

00:11:34.080 --> 00:11:37.170
What is the wish you want granted
if you become the King?

00:11:37.420 --> 00:11:39.220
I'm going to take down the King.

00:11:39.590 --> 00:11:40.590
That's all.

00:11:40.880 --> 00:11:43.890
I bet you just want to sit on
that throne and lord over everyone.

00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:50.310
Head into battle dressed in scarlet.
You invincible king of beasts.

00:11:50.810 --> 00:11:51.940
Accept.

00:11:52.480 --> 00:11:54.650
Lionel, Invincible Beast!

00:12:04.870 --> 00:12:07.080
Territory. Build Arise.

00:12:10.040 --> 00:12:11.870
Bottomless Canyon!

00:12:12.040 --> 00:12:14.380
Hot, hot, hot!

00:12:17.090 --> 00:12:24.340
During my turn, Bottomless Canyon gives all
of my units a Blitz of three thousand power.

00:12:24.640 --> 00:12:25.760
What's a Blitz?

00:12:25.760 --> 00:12:27.180
A pre-emptive strike.

00:12:27.600 --> 00:12:31.810
He can inflict damage before his opponent,
and hand him a one-sided defeat.

00:12:32.350 --> 00:12:36.110
Battle! I'm using Lionel to attack Partial Dealer.

00:12:42.900 --> 00:12:43.860
I'm not done.

00:12:44.280 --> 00:12:46.450
Activating Lionel's ability.

00:12:46.450 --> 00:12:50.120
When this unit wins the battle, I'll stand him.

00:12:50.620 --> 00:12:53.870
Then, along with the pre-emptive strike Blitz...

00:12:53.870 --> 00:12:58.040
He's going to keep launching attacks
until he wipes out Teruto's units.

00:12:58.290 --> 00:13:00.250
Using Lionel to attack Nadiya.

00:13:01.960 --> 00:13:03.170
I'll have him stand again.

00:13:03.590 --> 00:13:05.760
Lionel, attack his life!

00:13:08.850 --> 00:13:09.680
At a time like this?

00:13:12.890 --> 00:13:13.560
Again?

00:13:15.440 --> 00:13:16.770
End of turn.

00:13:17.440 --> 00:13:20.480
If you want those chips, fight back, Teruto.

00:13:20.770 --> 00:13:22.650
Master.

00:13:25.530 --> 00:13:29.450
I won't let anyone block my path.

00:13:30.490 --> 00:13:31.120
Draw.

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:32.790
Energy Set.

00:13:34.160 --> 00:13:36.830
Sending all living beings into chaos.

00:13:37.670 --> 00:13:40.090
Repeating death and rebirth.

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:41.300
Accept!

00:13:42.130 --> 00:13:44.670
Bloom, Soul Wager!

00:13:45.630 --> 00:13:47.640
Territory. Build Arise.

00:13:52.680 --> 00:13:54.430
Casino of Fate!

00:13:54.850 --> 00:13:56.940
This territory is vulgar.

00:13:57.270 --> 00:13:59.560
Activating Casino of Fate's ability.

00:14:00.060 --> 00:14:02.110
Sending two cards from my deck to the Cemetery.

00:14:02.110 --> 00:14:04.280
Checking if there are any Buster Cards.

00:14:04.400 --> 00:14:08.240
If he has either two or zero Buster Cards,
he can defeat Lionel.

00:14:11.370 --> 00:14:12.030
One?

00:14:12.240 --> 00:14:13.450
He guessed wrong.

00:14:14.120 --> 00:14:15.870
Losing one life.

00:14:16.370 --> 00:14:17.000
Huh.

00:14:17.370 --> 00:14:19.170
Too bad about that.

00:14:19.170 --> 00:14:22.130
I'm resting Bloom, and bringing back Nadiya.

00:14:22.340 --> 00:14:24.960
He's got to defeat Lionel, or else...

00:14:24.960 --> 00:14:26.050
But look!

00:14:26.340 --> 00:14:29.260
Thanks to that move, Master is leading by one life.

00:14:29.590 --> 00:14:30.760
My turn.

00:14:31.100 --> 00:14:34.930
That Ace. If I draw a Buster Card,
I'll get a power boost.

00:14:35.310 --> 00:14:38.850
In that case, three Energy to Accept Rabbian.

00:14:39.480 --> 00:14:41.560
Using Lionel to attack Nadiya.

00:14:43.900 --> 00:14:46.240
That guy just preserved his energy.

00:14:46.240 --> 00:14:47.030
What?

00:14:47.190 --> 00:14:48.400
Lionel, stand.

00:14:48.820 --> 00:14:50.660
Next, attack Bloom.

00:14:53.240 --> 00:14:54.950
Activating Bloom's ability.

00:14:55.160 --> 00:14:57.160
Sending one card from my deck to the Cemetery.

00:14:57.160 --> 00:15:01.170
If it turns out to be a Buster Card,
it will boost Bloom's power by five thousand.

00:15:01.250 --> 00:15:03.210
Huh. All you do is gamble.

00:15:03.840 --> 00:15:05.050
Buster Card.

00:15:05.300 --> 00:15:06.010
What?

00:15:10.300 --> 00:15:11.590
Not letting you do that.

00:15:11.590 --> 00:15:13.010
Quick Timing.

00:15:13.010 --> 00:15:15.600
Boosting Lionel's power by three thousand.

00:15:23.440 --> 00:15:25.230
That's how he's using his Energy?

00:15:25.480 --> 00:15:29.070
He's been attacked by Rabbian too,
and now he's down to four lives.

00:15:29.320 --> 00:15:31.200
His opponent has five lives.

00:15:31.200 --> 00:15:34.780
If he can't defeat Lionel during this turn,
things are going to get ugly.

00:15:35.030 --> 00:15:36.040
My turn.

00:15:36.910 --> 00:15:39.080
Activating the Casino of Fate.

00:15:40.580 --> 00:15:43.880
All right, this is where the fun really starts.

00:15:45.750 --> 00:15:46.710
Two Busters.

00:15:46.960 --> 00:15:48.300
He won again, damn it.

00:15:48.670 --> 00:15:50.800
Destroying all units!

00:15:54.600 --> 00:15:57.810
Not yet. I can't afford to lose just yet.

00:15:58.430 --> 00:16:01.020
Activating ability of the destroyed Lionel.

00:16:01.440 --> 00:16:03.400
Sending one life to the Energy Zone.

00:16:04.020 --> 00:16:06.980
Lionel's ability will be activated by three Energy.

00:16:07.610 --> 00:16:09.320
Rizome, Black Knight.

00:16:09.740 --> 00:16:10.820
Attack his life!

00:16:11.200 --> 00:16:14.160
For their sake too. I...

00:16:15.570 --> 00:16:16.200
End of turn.

00:16:16.200 --> 00:16:17.870
It's not over yet.

00:16:18.330 --> 00:16:23.040
Since I've paid three Energy,
Lionel will be revived at the end phase.

00:16:25.580 --> 00:16:28.130
Come back to life, Invincible Beast.

00:16:31.670 --> 00:16:32.930
My turn.

00:16:32.930 --> 00:16:37.300
If the Bottomless Canyon's ability
can yield more than eight Energy...

00:16:37.510 --> 00:16:40.220
Lionel's hits will be increased by one.

00:16:40.890 --> 00:16:41.810
No way!

00:16:41.810 --> 00:16:46.150
Not only that, but now he's added Eubird
and inflicted his Quick Command.

00:16:46.560 --> 00:16:47.770
Here it comes, Teruto.

00:16:48.070 --> 00:16:49.980
Using Lionel to launch a Two-Hit Attack.

00:16:51.110 --> 00:16:52.490
One more.

00:16:54.700 --> 00:16:56.030
Shot Trigger.

00:16:56.160 --> 00:16:57.830
Activating Cursed Trump Card.

00:16:58.910 --> 00:17:00.540
I've won this gamble.

00:17:01.410 --> 00:17:02.870
Destroying Lionel!

00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:07.380
<i>Teruto.</i>

00:17:08.340 --> 00:17:12.460
<i>What makes you come at me
with such an unswerving will?</i>

00:17:14.130 --> 00:17:16.220
<i>What's making you go this far?</i>

00:17:17.180 --> 00:17:20.510
<i>Does it have something to do
with the path you mentioned?</i>

00:17:21.430 --> 00:17:22.180
<i>Even still...</i>

00:17:22.890 --> 00:17:25.060
I can't afford to lose either!

00:17:25.560 --> 00:17:28.020
Accept two Baongulo, Divine Beast units.

00:17:28.310 --> 00:17:31.070
Two decoys. He's bolstering his defenses.

00:17:31.360 --> 00:17:33.530
The decoys will draw the attacks in.

00:17:33.530 --> 00:17:36.410
His lives can't be attacked
unless both decoys are defeated.

00:17:36.990 --> 00:17:38.950
Do I battle Bloom now?

00:17:39.200 --> 00:17:43.870
Thanks to my Territory ability,
Baongulo has 10,500 Blitz power.

00:17:44.460 --> 00:17:48.130
Even if Bloom uses her ability,
I have nothing to worry about.

00:17:49.590 --> 00:17:52.670
That hand, and the Energy in stand mode.

00:17:52.670 --> 00:17:54.050
Does he still have something up his sleeve?

00:17:58.010 --> 00:18:01.680
Even if he does,
I can defeat Bloom with my two units.

00:18:02.140 --> 00:18:06.690
But as of now, I can keep my decoys
and obliterate his lives!

00:18:07.060 --> 00:18:08.650
Using Baongulo to attack his life.

00:18:09.440 --> 00:18:10.770
Using the second Baongulo to attack.

00:18:11.770 --> 00:18:12.900
Come on, Burst!

00:18:15.740 --> 00:18:18.030
Master, please don't lose.

00:18:19.490 --> 00:18:20.700
End of turn.

00:18:21.030 --> 00:18:21.990
My turn.

00:18:22.240 --> 00:18:26.910
All right, will it be Casino of Fate again?
Let's see you try.

00:18:27.210 --> 00:18:28.920
There's no need to do that.

00:18:29.580 --> 00:18:33.550
The moment you feared Bloom,
your path was cut off.

00:18:33.710 --> 00:18:35.550
You won't have another turn.

00:18:36.260 --> 00:18:38.220
Activating Bloom's ability.

00:18:38.510 --> 00:18:40.390
Removing six cards from the Cemetery.

00:18:40.390 --> 00:18:42.100
Summoning Riverwort back.

00:18:44.220 --> 00:18:45.470
Activating his ability.

00:18:45.810 --> 00:18:48.770
Reducing all of my opponent's units
by six thousand power.

00:18:49.900 --> 00:18:53.480
But even if you take Baongulo down,
you can't reach me.

00:18:52.520 --> 00:18:53.730
There's a way.

00:18:54.110 --> 00:18:56.190
Command. One Night Nightmare.

00:18:56.530 --> 00:19:00.950
Having either unit in my Cemetery
appear under my command.

00:19:01.410 --> 00:19:02.620
Target...

00:19:04.580 --> 00:19:06.660
Imprisoned by a nightmare, revive.

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:10.710
Resurrected Berserker. Accept!

00:19:11.130 --> 00:19:13.130
Lionel, Invincible Beast!

00:19:14.040 --> 00:19:15.210
Lionel...

00:19:16.130 --> 00:19:18.800
No way, his opponent's Ace?

00:19:18.800 --> 00:19:20.050
Talk about merciless.

00:19:20.720 --> 00:19:23.260
Using Lionel to attack Baongulo!

00:19:26.720 --> 00:19:28.680
Stand one more time.

00:19:29.270 --> 00:19:31.690
Attacking Baongulo a second time!

00:19:34.360 --> 00:19:36.980
Using Riverwort to launch a Two-Hit Attack!

00:19:37.940 --> 00:19:39.280
Shot Trigger...

00:19:40.910 --> 00:19:42.110
I can't believe this guy.

00:19:42.950 --> 00:19:46.120
So cold-blooded, he'll stoop to any tactic to win.

00:19:46.740 --> 00:19:49.040
I'm going to take down the King.

00:19:50.330 --> 00:19:56.800
Teruto. I can see your only intent is
to follow that path relentlessly.

00:19:57.510 --> 00:19:59.420
Do it. Lionel.

00:20:09.770 --> 00:20:11.850
Winner. Teruto Kurabe.

00:20:12.230 --> 00:20:15.940
You actually won. What a comeback.

00:20:15.270 --> 00:20:17.780
All right, four chips!

00:20:18.190 --> 00:20:20.440
Are you satisfied that it went as planned?

00:20:20.820 --> 00:20:22.740
I don't know what you're talking about.

00:20:25.120 --> 00:20:26.990
So you're not fooling around then.

00:20:28.740 --> 00:20:29.540
Right.

00:20:33.080 --> 00:20:34.960
I guess I've still got a long way to go.

00:20:34.960 --> 00:20:36.590
Sure seems like it.

00:20:36.790 --> 00:20:37.840
Damn.

00:20:39.260 --> 00:20:43.300
Um, I feel like I'm the only one left behind.

00:20:43.800 --> 00:20:47.100
Yeah, but I'm going to keep on winning too.

00:20:47.100 --> 00:20:49.180
In order to change this city.

00:20:49.270 --> 00:20:51.730
You sure seem obsessed with Neo Kyoto.

00:20:52.020 --> 00:20:55.650
If you don't like this city,
you can always go live outside it.

00:20:58.480 --> 00:21:01.490
Master, is that a joke?

00:21:02.360 --> 00:21:05.410
Seriously, aside from battles,
you have no common sense.

00:21:07.660 --> 00:21:11.620
Listen, Master. Outside Neo Kyoto...

00:21:11.620 --> 00:21:13.620
...there is absolutely nothing.

00:21:18.920 --> 00:21:19.670
Huh?

00:22:51.510 --> 00:22:57.060
I never would've guessed that Teruto Kurabe
would become Sakura's surrogate.

00:22:57.480 --> 00:22:59.100
Are you looking at something?

00:22:59.520 --> 00:23:03.070
Nope. I was just thinking how blue the sky is today.

00:23:03.360 --> 00:23:06.030
You were just looking at Teruto, weren't you?

00:23:06.280 --> 00:23:07.650
Teruto?

00:23:07.950 --> 00:23:09.660
It's no use hiding it from me.

00:23:11.240 --> 00:23:12.950
I can tell.

00:23:13.830 --> 00:23:16.790
He's come back then, hasn't he?

00:23:17.750 --> 00:23:19.580
To my city.

00:23:23.960 --> 00:23:26.960
That makes me happy, Teruto.

00:23:26.960 --> 00:23:29.970
TO BE CONTINUED

00:23:30.340 --> 00:23:33.350
It's finally starting, but it won't be done anytime soon.

00:23:33.350 --> 00:23:35.350
I know this person.

00:23:35.350 --> 00:23:39.390
Hey Mister! Are you good at this?

00:23:36.520 --> 00:23:39.980
#04 Flower and Storm
